  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You wrap your body in a tangle of vines and roots, allowing you to drink deeply of the energy permeating the world.</p><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, you are <strong>Restrained</strong>.</p><p>Your <strong>Armor</strong> increases by <strong>+1</strong> from the flora wrapped around your body.</p><p>Additionally, you gain <strong>+1 bonus dice</strong> on all casting checks to cast spells.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>bonus dice</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may extend duration by <strong>+1 minutes</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may also increase the bonus to <strong>Armor</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.kjVYjSUbEKt3w1gU]{Wood Attunement}</p>",
